WEBVTT

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:17.070
<i>My name is Al Azif, the grimoire.</i>

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:20.090
<i>I am also known as the
</i>Necronomicon<i>.</i>

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:25.800
<i>When a powerful evil appears,
invariably I search for a mage</i>

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:28.830
<i>and destroy those blasphemers who use</i>

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:33.010
<i>even more blasphemous knowledge
to serve the twisted gods.</i>

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:39.230
<i>To me, a master was nothing
but a tool to my ends.</i>

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:43.960
<i>Kuro Daijuji, my master...</i>

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:47.450
<i>To me, you were just
another point in my life</i>

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:50.780
<i>that I would someday leave behind.</i>

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:53.540
<i>That's what I thought.</i>

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:04.540
Pathetic, Caligula, Claudius.

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:08.640
You should be ashamed of such a failure.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.560
Shut your damned trap.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:18.250
You were the jackass who told me that
the Tyrant had used all her power.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:20.540
The Tyrant was indeed weakened.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:23.920
That's probably why she used Kuro Daijuji.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:29.830
Thanks to your delay in finding her,
the two made contact.

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.420
You need to shut the hell up!

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.230
You want me to turn you into sashimi?

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:36.830
Stop.

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:38.670
It depresses me.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:47.160
But, Grand Master Therion,
the Tyrant is the key to Plan C.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.950
If she's escaped...

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:51.020
Very well.

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:55.160
We shall execute Plan C without the Tyrant.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.520
That's too dangerous!

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:01.730
I shall take the role she was to play.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:05.550
In place of the Nameless One,

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:07.570
we shall use my Liber Legis.

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:10.840
Grand Master...

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:13.400
Do you think my power insufficient?

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:17.380
No... Not at all.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.440
Enough.

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:23.350
Prepare for the ceremony.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:35.700
Now then, what will Augustus do?

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:39.890
Master, all of nature...

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.800
All the world is in your hands.

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:45.280
I don't know about that.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:50.270
This gun is impressive.

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:54.550
It's made from the same magical
theories as a Deus Machina.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.750
Just like the Scimitar of Barzai,

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:00.230
it functions as a ceremonial medium.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:01.850
Additionally, these bullets...

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:03.780
This must've taken quite a lot of work.

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:06.520
Each of these bullets has been baptized.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.080
<i>Tekeli-li.</i>

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:16.270
I thought so.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.870
The gunpowder's mixed with
the Powder of Ibn-Ghazi,

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:22.840
which acts as a catalyst to
materialize spiritual beings.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:27.680
This gives the bullet itself a magical eff...

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:32.320
If we have the materials, I can make more.

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:36.990
Now we have a way to control
not only Cthugha but Ithaqua, as well.

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:39.420
Let's make good use of it.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:43.060
<i>If it were all useless, could you still fight?</i>

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:50.500
What are you doing?

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.800
Are you going to sit there, depressed,
for the rest of eternity?

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:56.450
Stop dwelling on the past!

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.360
We still have a duty to fight for tomorrow.

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:04.950
I know that.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:10.380
I know it, but...
It's not that simple.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:15.140
Our messiah, Master Therion!

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:18.920
Our messiah, Master Therion!

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:22.500
Doctor...

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:26.370
Do you not have to participate
in the ceremony-robo?

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:30.120
My only job is to be me.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:35.510
But look at the massive favor
I've done for them!

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:37.390
What a tragedy...

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:40.150
I'm not participating in any
stupid ceremonies after this!

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:43.110
I want to punch my time card and enjoy

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.420
an elegant and gorgeous after-five life.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:47.810
But today is...

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.360
Overtime-robo.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:55.200
My friends, do you find anything suspicious
in the Grand Master's actions?

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:58.940
Disloyalty to the Grand Master?

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:01.370
That alone is treason.

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:08.010
Remember when we were but seconds
from finishing Kuro Daijuji,

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.080
and he issued a withdrawal order?

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:15.320
And he claimed that we needed not only
Al Azif, but the Tyrant, as well.

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:20.470
Augustus, what are you planning?

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:28.070
So I ask you if the Grand Master is
fit to carry out Plan C or not.

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:37.740
My honored companions,
well have you endured up till this day.

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:41.780
All of your endurance has
been for this moment.

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:46.220
For this day, when our Kingdom will come!

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:50.390
Master Therion! Master Therion!

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:52.820
Master Therion!

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:59.190
We shall build a new order,
in accordance with our faith.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:03.190
Yet the world has called us evil,

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.910
blasphemed us, and cut us off.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.280
Killed us.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.110
For we are the truth,

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:11.380
exposing the world's lies for what they are!

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.830
Thus, now do I declare to you...

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:17.210
That we shall destroy the apostates who
avert their eyes from the truth!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.520
That we shall do evil for evil's sake!

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:27.390
The Grand Master's acting skills
have improved considerably.

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:32.810
Now show me the usual climax.

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:35.130
Let us show the world that we have made

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.700
darkness do our bidding,

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:42.540
in our mobile fortress, "Dream Heart Mother"!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.840
Now then...

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:52.020
First let us fulfill our roles.

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:56.730
My grimoire, <i>The Golden Bough</i>.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:02.030
Time for your big show, <i>De
Vermis Mysteriis</i>!

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:07.670
<i>Cthaat Aquadingen!</i>

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.300
<i>Celaeno Fragments!</i>

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.710
<i>Book of Eibon!</i>

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:25.540
<i>Cultes des Goules</i>, come forth!

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:43.980
Plan C commences.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:47.770
Etheldreda...

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:49.480
Yes, Master.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.820
Come, Liber Legis.

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:06.790
It's finally begun.

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.510
Detective Nes,

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:24.140
a message from HQ!

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:26.960
A massive object has appeared
in sealed sector 13

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.710
and is flying toward the city.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.270
It says to be careful!

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:32.950
It's a bit late for that.

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:37.150
Who could miss that thing?

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:38.650
I-It's huge!

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:40.060
What is it?

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:42.130
That moon is scary!

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:46.340
I had no idea something so huge
was hidden in Sector 13.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:48.530
This is getting out of control.

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:50.210
Mistress...

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:52.690
That's insane...

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:55.810
It's too insane to exist!

00:09:55.810 --> 00:10:00.110
Something is being ejected from
the unidentified flying object!

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.610
Save me!

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:15.590
Fire!

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:23.890
Everyone!

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:26.450
Hurry and get to the shelters!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:45.190
Is everyone okay?

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:46.350
Kuro!

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:47.990
Look at that, Kuro!

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:52.560
They're unmanned?

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.440
Kuro, let's go!

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:03.940
Demonbane!

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.720
Listen to my words,

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:19.790
denizens of the city blessed by
magic and science, Arkham City.

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:25.330
The brighter your sparkle,
the blacker and deeper the darkness.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:28.360
This city served as the ideal place

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:30.770
for us to hide and build our strength.

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:34.250
It is thanks to your foolish obliviousness

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:36.390
that we are able to meet this happy day.

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:40.670
Thus, I'd like to give you a small thank you.

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:42.210
Master Therion...

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:44.880
Our long-awaited wish, Plan C.

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:48.220
I choose you to be the glorious sacrifices!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.770
I ask that your tears of despair,

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:56.690
your pain, and your blood adorn
the advent of Great C!

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.460
Sacrifices?

00:11:58.460 --> 00:11:59.660
No way in hell!

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:02.690
Let's begin, Etheldreda.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.600
Yes, master.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:09.610
Awaken, Great C!

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:13.580
<i>R'lyeh...</i>

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:18.130
<i>Iya! Iya! God... Cthulhu!</i>

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:28.430
<i>Cthulhu!</i>

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.630
<i>Cthulhu! Cthulhu!</i>

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:33.330
<i>Cthulhu!</i>

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:50.380
That's Cthulhu!

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:51.880
Cthulhu?

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:56.320
Yes... Ruler of a race that came to Earth
from the stars, in the distant past.

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:58.950
A Great Old One, wielding incredible power.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.890
The foul sea god,

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:04.600
sealed in the undersea city of R'lyeh,

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:06.660
where his dead sleep was
guarded by Deep Ones.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:12.100
We awaken that power and make it
the core of our fortress.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:16.260
Big C... The revival of the dark god Cthulhu...

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:17.980
That's Plan C?

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:21.470
Now none can stand in my way.

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:24.880
Come, come, come!

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:26.850
Show me the tragedy!

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:30.560
If Master Therion is a playwright,
who pens a comedy of evil,

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:35.500
then Kuro Daijuji is the playwright,
weaving a tragedy of good.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.960
You are two sides of the same coin,

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.800
two melodies that perform this
planet's mad rhapsody.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.850
Come, come, come!

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:47.300
Come and let the curtain open on this farce!

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:49.550
What?

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:53.180
How am I supposed to fight that monster?

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:56.680
Wh-What's wrong, Kuro?

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.020
Attack, already!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.180
Kuro!

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:06.850
Fool!

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.130
Al...

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:11.400
Even if it were all useless,

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.730
could you stand back and do nothing?!

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:17.620
Could you just sit back and watch?!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:21.710
Were the words you told that girl a lie?

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:26.090
Take back your strength.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:28.400
Take back your pride.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:30.310
You can still fight. I know it!

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:34.980
I know despair has not yet
taken over your soul!

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:40.020
If you still say you can't fight...

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:44.860
I will strengthen you.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.550
Al...

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:48.330
Don't try and bear it all yourself!

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:51.920
Pain and sadness and regret...

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.260
Let's share them together.

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:56.530
Kuro Daijuji, my master,

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:59.750
I respect and adore you,
and I believe in you.

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:05.740
Get back to your cockpit, Al.

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:11.860
Now that we've come this far, let's get to it!

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:15.060
Yeah, of course!

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:20.630
<i>Cthugha!</i>

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.230
<i>Ithaqua!</i>

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:27.300
<i>Out of the sky of hatred...</i>

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.750
<i>With righteous rage in its breast...</i>

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:41.350
<i>We take up the demon-slaying sword!</i>

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:51.090
<i>You are the innocent blade, Demonbane!</i>

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:53.760
Princess, can you hear me?

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.590
We're going to access the Hiranyapura System.

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:57.730
Send me the Naacal Code.

00:15:57.730 --> 00:15:59.370
Understood.

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:01.170
Transmitting incantation!

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:02.840
Decompressing spell!

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:07.340
<i>Lemuria Delay Impact!</i>

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.880
<i>Multiple sublimation!</i>

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.630
Master Therion!

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:29.900
<i>Lemuria...</i>

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:32.540
<i>Hyperborea Zero Drive!</i>

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:34.740
<i>...Impact!</i>

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:43.710
This is... Absolute Zero!

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:47.120
Hyperborea Zero Drive.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:50.080
By some coincidence, it is the
opposite of Lemuria Impact.

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:51.690
It is the Liber Legis's ultimate technique.

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:55.180
A blade of pure cold, burning white...

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:58.230
It would suffice to destroy even me.

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:01.700
Interesting... Then let's do this!

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:11.380
Deus Machina?

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:13.380
Anticross?

00:17:14.210 --> 00:17:17.070
Why have your left your positions?

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:19.350
It was my decision.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:25.140
I felt, now that Plan C is complete,
we should remove all obstacles.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:28.360
This is our one invaluable moment of play!

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:31.530
I refuse to allow your interference!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.660
Stand back!

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:36.070
That won't do, Grand Master.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:42.070
We have always been evil.

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:44.780
Did you expect loyalty?

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:46.080
What?

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:50.300
Master!

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:02.360
What just happened?

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:14.670
Attention, all my comrades of the Black Lodge.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.700
The Grand Master was deceiving us.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:21.830
He did not intend to use Plan C
to build our paradise.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:27.260
Rather, his twisted madness drove him
to use it to destroy the world.

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:32.960
So we, Anticross, have disposed of
the traitor, Master Therion.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.570
Thus, all the Black Lodge is now controlled

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:38.480
by its highest ranking members, Anticross.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.600
Now let us finish this.

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.410
Farewell, then.

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:00.250
<i>Demonbane...</i>

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:02.420
<i>No, this is...</i>

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:06.220
<i>This is my former Deus Machina, Aion.</i>

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:10.630
<i>And the bodies of the masters I used...</i>

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:13.260
<i>The corpses they and I trod upon.</i>

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:15.590
<i>Wasn't it painful?</i>

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:19.580
<i>Not even being able to cry?
Having to just sit there and watch?</i>

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:22.160
<i>It's happened again and again, up to now.</i>

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.910
<i>It is my destiny.</i>

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:26.880
<i>You don't even know how to be sad?</i>

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:30.890
<i>When one life ends, I find a new caster,</i>

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:32.970
<i>and go to the next battle.</i>

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:34.860
<i>That is my destiny.</i>

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:39.570
<i>You're not as capable of being
cold and detached as you believe.</i>

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.370
<i>How could it be painful?</i>

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:43.980
<i>There was no sadness there.
There could not be.</i>

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:47.900
<i>Can't you be honest with yourself now?</i>

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:52.400
<i>But I've never felt this way before...</i>

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:55.070
<i>Pain and sadness and regret...</i>

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:57.110
<i>We'll share them together, right?</i>

00:19:57.110 --> 00:20:02.110
<i>I don't know why I'm thinking this.</i>

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:06.080
<i>Al... I'm by your side.</i>

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:10.060
<i>Kuro, I don't want to lose you.</i>

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:12.260
<i>You're the one person I don't want to lose!</i>

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:15.360
<i>If I... I'd rather...</i>

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.360
<i>Al...</i>

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:22.230
<i>That's right. This feeling is...</i>

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.470
Kuro, I...

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:39.410
Am I saved?

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:41.580
Al!

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:44.190
Are you okay?

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:46.860
H-Hey!

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:48.950
Wake up, Al.

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:50.130
We're saved.

00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:51.170
Open your eyes!

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:51.730
Hey!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:53.200
Al!

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:56.420
Al! Wait!

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:58.180
What kind of joke is this?

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.100
Al!

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:01.300
Wait, Al!

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:02.150
Wait!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:04.160
Al... Al!

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:09.410
Al...

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:14.150
<i>Al!</i>

00:22:55.050 --> 00:22:57.720
Villians have their own aesthetic...

00:22:57.720 --> 00:23:00.930
Something like a falling star or a flash of thunder!

00:23:00.930 --> 00:23:01.970
But!

00:23:01.970 --> 00:23:04.030
You lack that!

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:05.940
Next time: Shadow In the Dark.

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:09.340
Now, my rival, it's time for a counterattack!
